        "app_name": "Fire Extinguisher Use Simulation",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "1. Get a fire extinguisher: Grab a working fire extinguisher from the fire extinguisher rack on the right. Check the green color of the pressure gauge to determine if it's working.\n2. Prepare to use the extinguisher: When a fire occurs, pull out the safety pin on the handle, hold the hose toward the fire, squeeze the handle, and spray toward the fire.\n3. Use a safe position: Stand with your back to the wind, or if indoors, with your back to the door.\n4. Use a throwing extinguisher: If the fire starts again, try using a throwing extinguisher to put it out.",
